    {
      "attributes": {
        "description": "Hosts subscribed to each multicast group via IGMP at the time Zeek logged traffic to that group. Count is the number of multicast events seen for the group while the host was subscribed, not traffic the host sent. Membership is per group regardless of port. Look for hosts in groups that don’t fit their role, such as a gateway or controller joined to Windows name-resolution groups.",
